        "icon": 10,
        "id": 1002,
        "payload": "### Tips & Tricks\n- After creating a new file, if you plan to insert images from the local file system using relative paths, it is recommended to first save the file in its intended location so that the image paths can be properly resolved.\n- To insert a hoizontal rule, you must press Enter after typing three dashes; otherwise, the rule will not be created.\n- There is no shortcut for creating bold and italic formatting like ***This text is bold and italic***. To achieve this, enclose the text with three asterisks: &#42;&#42;&#42;This text is bold and italic&#42;&#42;&#42;\n\n",
